@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram - Digital Watch

state StartWatch
state HourAdjustment
state MinuteAdjustment
state AlarmHourAdjustment
state AlarmMinuteAdjustment
state AlarmOn[*]
state AlarmOff
state LightOn[*]
state LightOff

StartWatch:! --> HourAdjustment: Start Adjusting Time
HourAdjustment: Adjust Hour: HourAdjustment: AlarmOn
AlarmOn[*]: HourAdjustment: Adjust Alarm On: AlarmOn
AlarmOff: AlarmOn[*]: Adjust Alarm Off: AlarmOff
LightOn[*]: StartWatch: Light On: LightOn --> LightOn: Light On
LightOff: LightOn[*]: Light Off: LightOff --> LightOff: Light Off

title UML State Machine Diagram - Online College Magazine System

state LoginChoice
state AdminProfileManagement
state ArticleReview
state ContentCreation
state Editing
state AccessDenied
state PublishedArticles
state SearchArticle
state FeedbackProvided

LoginChoice:! --> AdminProfileManagement: Login Successful
AdminProfileManagement: Admin Profile Management --> ContentCreation: Create/Edit User Profile
ContentCreation: Edit User Profile --> ArticleReview: Articles Ready for Review
ArticleReview: Edit Articles --> Editing: Editing Completed
Editing: Edited Articles --> AccessDenied: Access Denied
PublishedArticles: ArticleReview: Publish Articles --> PublishedArticles
SearchArticle: PublishedArticles: Search for More Articles --> ProductExploration
FeedbackProvided: SearchArticle: Provide Feedback --> LoginChoice: Return to Login

title UML State Machine Diagram - Smart Traffic Management System

state TrafficMonitoring
state StreetLightControl
state TrafficSignalManagement
state VehicleNumberCapture
state RuleVerification
state NoViolation
state ViolationRecorded
state FinePaid
state WarningSent

TrafficMonitoring:! --> VehicleNumberCapture: Monitoring Started
VehicleNumberCapture: Capture Vehicle Numbers --> RuleVerification: Verifying Rules
RuleVerification: Verify Traffic Rules --> NoViolation: No Violation Detected
NoViolation: RuleVerification: No Violation --> TrafficMonitoring: Monitoring Continued
ViolationRecorded: RuleVerification: Recorded Violation --> FinePaid[*]
FinePaid[*]: ViolationRecorded: Fine Paid --> TrafficMonitoring: Monitoring Continued
WarningSent[*]: ViolationRecorded: Warning Sent --> TrafficMonitoring: Monitoring Continued

title UML State Machine Diagram - Online Marketplace

state Registration
state Verification
state SellerWorkspace
state ProductAddition
state ProductPromotion
state CustomerDashboard
state ProductExploration
state ProductViewing
state PurchaseDecision
state Logout

Registration:! --> Verification: Account Created
Verification: Verify Account --> SellerWorkspace[*]
SellerWorkspace[*]: Verified Account --> ProductAddition: Add New Products
ProductAddition: Added New Products --> ProductPromotion: Promote Existing Products
ProductPromotion: Promoted Existing Products --> CustomerDashboard[*]
CustomerDashboard[*]: Access Dashboard --> ProductExploration: Explore Products
ProductExploration: Explored Products --> ProductViewing: View Available Products
ProductViewing: Proceed with Purchase or Stop Browsing --> PurchaseDecision
PurchaseDecision: Purchase Decision Made --> Logout: Log Out
@enduml
